/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 36 0 R
/T (This project designs and implements an automated, secure, and fault-tolerant Extract-Transform-Load \(ETL\) pipeline in ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps. By establishing an intermediate staging layer \(u_imp_employee_data\), defining field-mapping relationships to the target production table \(sys_user\), enforcing unique Coalesce constraints, and executing server-side Transform Scripts \(onBefore\), this solution guarantees zero duplicate creation, validates incoming data integrity, and produces verifiable audit trails. )
/E (This project designs and implements an automated, secure, and fault-tolerant Extract-Transform-Load \(ETL\) pipeline in ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps. By establishing an intermediate staging layer \(u_imp_employee_data\), defining field-mapping relationships to the target production table \(sys_user\), enforcing unique Coalesce constraints, and executing server-side Transform Scripts \(onBefore\), this solution guarantees zero duplicate creation, validates incoming data integrity, and produces verifiable audit trails. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
